+ * as an array of 8-bit Keyboard/Keypad usages, both byte-aligned.
+ *
+ * @rdesc:	report descriptor
+ * @len:	length of @rdesc in bytes
+ * @layout:	returns the layout of the report
+ * Return: 0 if found, -ENOENT if there is no such report, other -ve if
+ *	the descriptor exceeds what is parsed
+ */
